llapsed="true">Says hi to the player </comment></block><l>2</l></block></script><list></list></block><block s="doAsk"><l>What do you want the max number you can guess to be </l></block><block s="doIf"><block s="getLastAnswer"></block><script><block s="doSetVar"><l>Maxium</l><block s="getLastAnswer"></block></block></script><list></list><comment w="90" collapsed="true">set the maxium </comment></block><block s="doSetVar"><l>Secret number</l><block s="reportRandom"><l>1</l><block var="Maxium"/></block><comment w="90" collapsed="true">Sets the secret number</comment></block><block s="doForever"><script><block s="doAsk"><l>Guess the secret number</l></block><block s="doIfElse"><block s="reportVariadicEquals"><list><block s="getLastAnswer"></block><block var="Secret number"/></list></block><script><block s="doSayFor"><block s="reportJoinWords"><list><block var="Name"/><l> you guessed it!! The secret number is </l><block var="Secret number"/></list></block><l>2</l></block><block s="doSayFor"><block s="reportJoinWords"><list><l>Youve guessed </l><block var="Number of tries"/></list></block><l>2</l><comment w="90" collapsed="true">Tell them youve tried this many times </comment></block><block s="doSetVar"><l>Incorrect guess</l><l>0</l><comment w="90" collapsed="true">reset number of tries&#xD;</comment></block><block s="doStopThis"><l><option>this script</option></l></block></script><script><block s="doSetVar"><l>Incorrect guess</l><block s="getLastAnswer"></block><comment w="90" collapsed="true">Set the incorrect guess variable &#xD;</comment></block><block s="doSayFor"><block s="reportJoinWords"><list><l>Sorry </l><block var="Name"/><l>That is not the right anwser</l></list></block><l>2</l><comment w="90" collapsed="true">If wrong says that you choose the wrong anwser and lets you try again </comment></block><block s="doIf"><block s="reportVariadicLessThan"><list><block var="Secret number"><comment w="90" collapsed="true">If the number your guessed was smaller than the secret number say it was smaller</comment></block><block var="Incorrect guess"/></list></block><script><block s="doSayFor"><l>Secret number is smaller</l><l>2</l></block></script><list></list></block><block s="doIf"><block s="reportVariadicGreaterThan"><list><block var="Secret number"/><block var="Incorrect guess"/></list><comment w="90" collapsed="true">Say the number you guessed is bigger than the secret number&#xD;</comment></block><script><block s="doSayFor"><l>Secret number is bigger</l><l>2</l></block></script><list></list></block><block s="doChangeVar"><l>Number of tries</l><l>1</l><comment w="90" collapsed="false">Count how many tries youve done </comment></block></script><comment w="90" collapsed="true">If the secret number is found says your name and what was the secret variable and ends the script</comment></block></script></block></script></scripts></sprite><watcher var="Name" style="normal" x="10" y="10" color="243,118,29"/><watcher var="Incorrect guess" style="normal" x="10" y="31.000001999999995" color="243,118,29"/></sprites></stage><variables><variable name="Name"><l>Ikram</l></variable><variable name="Incorrect guess"><l>0</l></variable></variables></scene></scenes></project>